{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31594","headline":"哭小女痴儿 · 李羣玉","name":"哭小女痴儿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生未省梦熊罴，稚女如花坠晓枝。\n条蔓纵横输葛藟，子孙蕃育羡螽斯。\n方同王衍锺情切，犹念商瞿有庆迟。\n负尔五年恩爱泪，眼中惟有涸泉知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}